 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Love Gives Me Superpowers"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "恋爱让我有了超能力"
   },
   {
    "zh-hk": "戀愛讓我有了超能力"
   },
   {
    "zh-ro": "Lian'ai Rang Wo Youle Chao Nengli"
   },
   {
    "en": "Falling In Love Gives Me Superpowers"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Art student Zhong Shenxiu encountered a problem during a sketching class. She couldn't \"truly see\" Xu Ke, a top student and the subject of the sketch. If she can't truly see the subject then she can't draw. Zhong Shenxiu put down her paintbrush. If she became a better student, she would be able to get closer to her, right? If she could get closer to her, then she could truly see her, right? Until the distance between them is no more--Face to face. Phew! Now I can finally see her! But! This is... Too close! Help! What Should I do?!!!"
  },
